@startuml
title SSHSS SysML State Machine

[*] --> Initializing
Initializing --> Disarmed : self-test complete / restore configuration
Initializing --> Degraded : critical self-test fault / report fault

Disarmed --> ExitDelay : armAway [authorized] / start exit timer
Disarmed --> ArmedStay : armStay [authorized] / bypass configured interior zones
ExitDelay --> ArmedAway : timer expired [exit clear] / enable all configured zones
ExitDelay --> Disarmed : cancel [authorized]
ExitDelay --> ExitDelay : protected-zone event / warn user

ArmedAway --> EntryDelay : delayed-zone event / start entry timer, request clip
ArmedAway --> Alarm : instant-zone event / activate alarm actions
ArmedStay --> EntryDelay : delayed perimeter event / start entry timer, request clip
ArmedStay --> Alarm : instant perimeter event / activate alarm actions
EntryDelay --> Disarmed : disarm [authorized] / cancel pending alarm
EntryDelay --> Alarm : timer expired / siren, incident, clips, alerts
Alarm --> Disarmed : disarm [authorized] / silence, retain incident
Alarm --> Alarm : additional event / append to incident
ArmedAway --> Disarmed : disarm [authorized]
ArmedStay --> Disarmed : disarm [authorized]

state Degraded {
  [*] --> Reporting
  Reporting : Continue safe available local functions
  Reporting : Display unavailable coverage
}

Disarmed --> Degraded : unrecoverable controller fault
Degraded --> Initializing : fault cleared / self-test

note right of Alarm
Alarm preempts ordinary operation.
Loss of cloud, camera, or WAN is a health condition,
not a transition that suppresses local alarming.
end note
@enduml

